Here’s a simple Android game using **Kotlin** and **XML** — a **"Click Counter" Game**, where the user gains a point every time they tap a button.

---

### **1. MainActivity.kt**

```kotlin
package com.example.simplegame

import android.os.Bundle
import android.widget.Button
import android.widget.TextView
import androidx.appcompat.app.AppCompatActivity

class MainActivity : AppCompatActivity() {
    private var score = 0

    override fun onCreate(savedInstanceState: Bundle?) {
        super.onCreate(savedInstanceState)
        setContentView(R.layout.activity_main)

        val scoreText: TextView = findViewById(R.id.scoreText)
        val clickButton: Button = findViewById(R.id.clickButton)

        clickButton.setOnClickListener {
            score++
            scoreText.text = "Score: $score"
        }
    }
}
```

---

### **2. activity\_main.xml**

```xml
<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<RelativeLayout xmlns:android="http://schemas.android.com/apk/res/android"
    xmlns:tools="http://schemas.android.com/tools"
    android:id="@+id/mainLayout"
    android:layout_width="match_parent"
    android:layout_height="match_parent"
    tools:context=".MainActivity"
    android:padding="20dp"
    android:background="#FFEB3B">

    <TextView
        android:id="@+id/scoreText"
        android:layout_width="wrap_content"
        android:layout_height="wrap_content"
        android:text="Score: 0"
        android:textSize="30sp"
        android:textStyle="bold"
        android:layout_centerHorizontal="true"
        android:layout_marginTop="100dp" />

    <Button
        android:id="@+id/clickButton"
        android:layout_width="200dp"
        android:layout_height="wrap_content"
        android:text="Click Me!"
        android:textSize="20sp"
        android:layout_below="@id/scoreText"
        android:layout_centerHorizontal="true"
        android:layout_marginTop="50dp"
        android:background="#2196F3"
        android:textColor="#FFFFFF" />
</RelativeLayout>
```

---

### **3. AndroidManifest.xml**

Make sure this is present:

```xml
<application
    android:allowBackup="true"
    android:icon="@mipmap/ic_launcher"
    android:label="SimpleGame"
    android:roundIcon="@mipmap/ic_launcher_round"
    android:supportsRtl="true"
    android:theme="@style/Theme.AppCompat.Light.DarkActionBar">
    
    <activity android:name=".MainActivity">
        <intent-filter>
            <action android:name="android.intent.action.MAIN"/>
            <category android:name="android.intent.category.LAUNCHER"/>
        </intent-filter>
    </activity>
</application>
```

